  "id": "USN-8909-1",
  "summary": "libde265 vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libde265 did not properly validate certain crafted\nH.265 bitstreams, leading to a NULL pointer dereference. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause libde265 to crash, resulting in a denial\nof service.",
